name conversation_loss_5pct
describe User <-> AI conversation, audio, 100 ms RTT, 5% random loss each way (#757)
call two-way
video off
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms loss=5%
reverse at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms queue=300ms loss=5%
turn user 1s-4s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 10s-13s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 19s-22s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
# program.md 6.3, conversation rows: the user hears every reply (sev:1); on a 100 ms RTT link with <= 5% loss the
# transport adds at most 500 ms to the response (sev:2).
expect conv.responses == 3
expect conv.response_delay_p95_ms < 500
# program.md 6.3 sev:2 conversation: at most 2% of the user's speech lost or concealed on the way to the AI (#755).
expect conv.user_speech_lost_pct <= 2
